{{!-- A Layout override (ADR 0006): the tag archive Surface in the List layout whatever
`feed_layout` says. Inert until a routes.yaml entry names it as a template; tag.hbs follows
the setting. Name it from a `controller: channel` route with `data: tag.{slug}`,
which supplies the `tag`; a channel with `data:` redirects that Tag's own URL to itself. Not
`tag-{layout}.hbs`: Ghost would resolve that for a Tag whose slug is the layout's name. --}}

